MACQWEN

This repository does not include model weights.

The current research checkpoint is `sh0wie/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-REAP-288-MLX-4bit`.
Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-MLX-oQ3-MTP, Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-MLX-oQ4, and Qwen3.8-27B
checkpoints are distributed separately by their publishers. Review each
checkpoint license before download, use, modification, or redistribution.

K2-Horizon-7B-MLX-8bit is distributed separately by abenzerps and includes a
checkpoint-supplied MLX model implementation. Its own license terms apply.

Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-mlx-2bit is distributed separately by prism-ml under
Apache-2.0 and includes a checkpoint-supplied runtime loader. Its own license
terms apply.

MLX, MLX-LM, MLX-VLM, Transformers, NumPy, Requests, Hugging Face Hub, and
other dependencies are separate projects. Their own license terms apply.

MACQWEN includes local compatibility and runtime patches. These patches do not
change the licenses of upstream projects or model checkpoints.
